+**A. Linux (`linuxMain` - using `io_uring`)**
+
+The files you provided in `linux_uring/include/` (like `UringSetupFlags.kt`, `UringOpcode.kt`, `helpers.kt` containing `t_create_ring_params`) form a very good basis for the `actual` implementation of `AsyncIoEngine` on Linux.
