+
+**I. New `expect` Declarations for Asynchronous I/O (in `commonMain`)**
+
+We'll define these in a new file, `AsyncIo.kt`, within the `borg.trikeshed.reactor` package. This new system will provide a completion-queue-based model suitable for `io_uring` and `kqueue`.
